    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common (Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster)</em></p><p>Etched with eldritch runes, this 1-inch-diameter ruby allows you to use a Simple or Martial weapon as a Spellcasting Focus for your spells. For this property to work, you must attach the ruby to the weapon by pressing the ruby against it for at least 10 minutes. Thereafter, the ruby can’t be removed unless you detach it as a Magic action, the weapon is destroyed, or your Attunement to the ruby ends.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-7HuDc1Pk8WvCut5V\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Attach Ruby</strong> activity allows you to select a single Simple or Martial weapon and marks it as a Focus and appends \" of the War Mage\" to its name to ease tracking. You can send the <em>Ruby of the War Mage</em> again to see the enchanted item and, optionally, remove it.</p></section>",
